slint provides CMake targets:

    find_package(Slint CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Slint::Slint)

The slint-compiler tool is installed in tools or bin; use it (or the
slint_target_sources() / slint! macro flows) to compile .slint files
ahead of time. The available renderers were selected at package install
time via the port features software (default), femtovg and skia; at
runtime the renderer is chosen with the SLINT_BACKEND environment
variable (winit-software / winit-femtovg / winit-skia).
